      "writtenOn": "2026-10-31T01:13:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is the right signal for clearing. If we introduce a new type of buffer that we can wrap, or there is a need to allocate a new_content structure for dmabuf, we\u0027ll skip over this in the rewrap case, even though we should unconditionally clear in rewrap, no?",
      "revId": "34f3d36c2737f67ba0ecd3fe3f0dc619f9c23aee",
